{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"ac17f0f48d82c2f4d89d006ce72cf3ce3ac70717dce819f3cb2f416f1d302617","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e1343327ead953361b1fefe6fb85fd1569679eb6b9a269a08a6f5c1c8a473152","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“每回合吸取 %d 体力”误示获得体力或从对方抽取；tome 固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 的 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:1429-1436 对效果持有者 self 调用 incStamina(-eff.drain)，实际为其每回合消耗体力。"},{"revision_key":"e200845e1abc8076051b8f755bd28ff1bfe68ebb7009b6c15f1c8a473152","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“减少……敌人的意志”把比喻性的 shatters the will 误写成降低意志属性；tome 固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 的 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/warcries.lua:111-124 仅施加 BATTLE_CRY，game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/mental.lua:271-284 仅降低 combat_def 并设置 no_evasion、blind_fighted，未降低意志属性。"}]}